<%- include('partials/sitenav', { active: '' }) %>

<section class="hero hero-inner-page">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated 1 June 2026. By creating an account or using Evo Meals, you agree to these terms.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap legal-content">

    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>Evo Meals is a platform connecting parents, students, schools, and an independent catering partner — it does not itself prepare or cook food. It lets parents book and pay for their child's meals, lets school administrators see program activity for their own school, and lets schools and caterers get in touch about partnering with us. Meal preparation and delivery are carried out by our catering partner, not by Evo Meals directly.</p>

    <h2>Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You're responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for activity that happens under your account.</li>
      <li>Parent accounts are for managing your own children's bookings, meals, and payments — not for other families.</li>
      <li>One account per customer or device — duplicate memberships for the same family aren't permitted.</li>
      <li>School admin accounts are provisioned for a specific school and are scoped to that school's own data only.</li>
      <li>Information you provide — including a student's allergy details — should be accurate and kept up to date, since it's used to prepare meals safely.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Bookings, orders, and payments</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A subscription is charged only for the real school working days it covers, calculated against your school's actual calendar — never a flat fee. The exact amount is shown before you confirm.</li>
      <li>Once submitted, an order cannot be edited — cancel it instead (subject to the cancellation window shown at the time of booking) and place a new booking if your choices change.</li>
      <li>Cancelling an eligible booking refunds the corresponding amount to your original payment method, subject to the cancellation window shown at the time of booking.</li>
      <li>A subscription's coverage runs through the end of the calendar month it starts in, and can be renewed manually before it ends — renewing recalculates the charge fresh against the new month's real school days, never repeating the previous amount.</li>
      <li>Delivery times are targeted, not guaranteed — meal delivery can be affected by traffic, school schedule changes, and other factors outside our catering partner's control.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Allergen and dietary information</h2>
    <p>Special dietary claims shown on a dish — including nut-free, shellfish-free, sesame-free, soy-free, egg-free, gluten-free, and lactose-free — apply to that specific meal preparation. They are not a blanket guarantee across every dish on the platform, and they are not independently verified by Evo Meals. If your child has a specific allergy, check the individual dish's information and use your own judgment before booking.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to misuse the platform — including attempting to access another family's or another school's data, submitting false allergy or safety information, or using the partnership inquiry forms for anything other than a genuine school or catering inquiry.</p>

    <h2>Catering and school partners</h2>
    <p>Submitting a partnership inquiry through our Schools or Caterers pages does not on its own create a contractual relationship. It starts a conversation — any partnership, onboarding, or data-sharing arrangement is confirmed separately in writing.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms as the platform evolves. Material changes will be reflected here with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, or by email to <strong>legal@evomeals.example</strong>.</p>

  </div>
</section>

